1
00:00:02,459 --> 00:00:09,509
Lesson 7. Susan hires Bob to run her business. Susan stays up all night thinking about her

2
00:00:09,359 --> 00:00:15,290
cookie business. In the morning she discusses it with Bob. Bob agrees to work for her.

3
00:00:16,239 --> 00:00:22,570
You're up bright and early this morning, Susan. I didn't sleep a wink. I was awake all night

4
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:27,570
thinking about the new business. Running your own business is lots of work. Are you prepared

5
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:33,769
to work like a dog? No, but I am prepared to hire you to run the business. You want me to

6
00:00:33,619 --> 00:00:39,649
run a cookie business? Fat chance. Why not? I don't have a clue about making cookies.

7
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:44,990
I don't even know how to turn the oven on. I'll give you a crash course. Do I have to do

8
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:50,750
the baking? No. You'll just manage the business side. Needless to say, I have mixed feelings

9
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:56,990
about working for you. I'll be nice. I promise you'll be a happy camper. Okay, let's give

10
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,809
a shot, boss.

